# B-line IL, B1 (streaming slab pass) §4: the whole pass (generic lanes)

`passP = rptX rNB blockP; rptX rTOT (mv rACC 0)`: the blocks, then the output (collected
reversed on `rACC`) is moved onto stack `0`. **`pass_runs`**: from the lane state with the input
